// The package's published surface: the five entry points the policy's
// workforce table names. Bases, cores and the de-identification sources are
// building blocks and are not exported, so a direct query to any of them is
// refused (policy AC-02). The bare import carries the surfaces' secure givens
// onto this model's surface, where the gates read them.
##! experimental { access_modifiers givens }

import "surfaces.malloy"

export { patient_chart, billing, population_health, partner_lds, research }
